Implemented real control flow. Router/branch node type in engine.rs: advance_to_node() checks node_type 'router'|'branch', skips task creation, takes the last completed node's output, evaluates outgoing edge conditions immediately, and advances to the matching target. This enables conditional branching without an agent - just condition evaluation. New BranchNode.svelte with amber theme. Replaced Decision/Human sidebar templates with single 'Branch' control flow node. Right panel shows branch explanation and lists outgoing conditions. YAML type: router supported in definition.rs.
